# Web (`web/`) — Next.js 16 + Tailwind 4 + Redux persist

## Folder map

```
web/src/app/            routes only (thin pages)
web/src/components/     reusable UI
web/src/store/          Redux store, persist, slices
web/src/lib/api.ts      the only HTTP client
web/src/lib/types.ts    DTO shapes matching the Nest API
```

Pages compose components and dispatch/select. They do not contain Prisma, raw `fetch`, or ad-hoc `localStorage`.

## Redux

- Store: `web/src/store/store.ts`
- Hooks: `web/src/store/hooks.ts` (`useAppDispatch`, `useAppSelector`)
- Persist whitelist: `auth`, `filters`, `buyerFilters`, `locale`
- `auth`: JWT + current user (demo prototype)
- `filters`: catalog query that must survive refresh
- `buyerFilters`: seller desk buyer search
- `locale`: EN/UK UI language
- Server listings/inquiries are **not** persisted in Redux — refetch from Nest

New client state: add a slice next to the others, then whitelist it only if it must survive refresh.

## Next.js

- App Router in `src/app`
- Interactive Redux UI is `"use client"`
- `StoreProvider` wraps the tree in `app/layout.tsx`
- Authz UX (hide nav, redirect) is client-side; **real** authz is Nest

## Tailwind

Use the tokens in `globals.css`: `background`, `foreground`, `gold`, `gold-2`, `card`, `muted`, `line`.
Dark fintech look (N5Deal-inspired). Do not introduce a second palette.
